{
  "format": "souls-form-cases/1",
  "about": "eden:sealed_letter (from #1685). One message, written once (words by reference), sealed in red wax, then opened once: blank, written, sealed, opened, and an opened seal is never sealed again. Each needs the Soul within reach of its face ('Walk up to the correspondence before composing or changing its seal.') and empty hands ('Set down what you are holding before composing or changing the seal.'). A seal on a blank letter names writing it as the fix; opening a written one names sealing it. The words are readable when sealed: no secrecy, as in the original.",
